{"id":"n62155-1-8","stage":2,"title":"삭제 · 删除","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62155-1-8-1","ko":"책에서 이 부분은 남겨 놓을까요?","zh":"这本书的这部分要保留下来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책에서","meaning":"书","explanation":"책：书；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"3","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부분은","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남겨","meaning":"留下","explanation":"남기다：留下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"7","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"表达“书籍”意思的词。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"留下","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371","definition":"因某事或某种状况，使其出现什么结果。","pronunciation":["남기다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/00a037f4fcf3cc2b1289.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62155-1-8-2","ko":"아니요. 삭제를 하는 게 좋겠어요.","zh":"不用了，最好删掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삭제를","meaning":"删除","explanation":"삭제：删除；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"삭제","audio":"/audio/6139b6c3ed73cd4aa384.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62155","senseId":"1","lemma":"삭제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"6139b6c3ed73cd4a","term":"삭제","zh":"删除","audio":"/audio/6139b6c3ed73cd4aa384.mp3","entryId":"62155","definition":"除去或删掉的行为。","pronunciation":["삭쩨"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d95b430b6fa9a4ac86c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62155","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不用了，最好删掉吧。","你们俩为什么吵架？","这本书的这部分要保留下来吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不用了，最好删掉吧。","这本书的这部分要保留下来吗？","你们俩为什么吵架？"],"answer":0}]}
